  {
   "name": "Support",
   "key": "role_support",
   "html": "<h4>Lt. Morales</h4>\n<p><img alt=\"Divider_Hero_LtMorales_Crop.png\" data-id=\"20256907\" src=\"https://bnetcmsus-a.akamaihd.net/cms/content_folder_media/yd/YDNL0OKJTAHV1445037034465.png\"/></p>\n<p><span class=\"pn-h\"><strong>Talents</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"pn-name\"><strong>Level 16</strong></span>\n<ul>\n<li>Inoculation (W)\n<ul>\n<li>Removed</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote><em><strong>Developer Comments:  </strong></em>With the newly implemented Armor system, Inoculation and Shield Sequencer were both doing very similar things for Morales. We like the interaction and decision making that Shield Sequencer grants, so we have decided to keep it and remove Inoculation for now.</blockquote>\n<h4>Rehgar</h4>\n<p><img alt=\"Divider_Hero_Rehgar_Crop.png\" data-id=\"17042296\" src=\"https://bnetcmsus-a.akamaihd.net/cms/content_folder_media/HM0ECRA7F3U91417483335126.png\"/></p>\n<p><strong class=\"pn-h\">Abilities</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"pn-name\"><strong>Bloodlust (R)</strong></span>\n<ul>\n<li>Duration reduced from 10 to 8 seconds</li>\n<li>Movement Speed bonus reduced from 30 to 25%</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://bnetcmsus-a.akamaihd.net/cms/content_folder_media/19RBT3IUQUYB1403137112368.png\"/></h3>\n<h4></h4>",
