   "html": "<p><span class=\"pn-h\"><strong>Heroes, Abilities, and Talents</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Azmodan:</strong> Can no longer mount while channeling All Shall Burn.</li>\n<li><strong>Dehaka:</strong> Fixed an issue that caused Dark Swarm to deal more damage than intended to Minions, and Mercenaries after learning Primal Aggression.</li>\n<li><strong>Dehaka:</strong> Fixed an issue that caused Dark Swarm to deal bonus damage to Monsters after learning Primal Aggression.</li>\n</ul>\n<p></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://bnetcmsus-a.akamaihd.net/cms/content_folder_media/g6/G6G0N80EOC941426801305139.png\"/></p>\n<p><img alt=\"InvisibleDividerLine_800x50.png\" data-id=\"14509591\" src=\"https://bnetcmsus-a.akamaihd.net/cms/content_folder_media/6VA2831Q81IU1403137406234.png\"/></p>\n<style type=\"text/css\">img\n{\ndisplay: block;\n}\n</style>\n<style type=\"text/css\">p\n{\ndisplay:inline;\n}\n</style>\n<style type=\"text/css\">ul.tile-list {\nwidth: 100%;\noverflow: hidden;\nmargin: 30px 0 0;\n}\nli.tile-list-item {\nfloat: left;\nclear: left;\nmargin: 0 0 20px;\nlist-style: none;\n}\nli.tile-list-item h4 {\ntext-align: center;\nmargin-bottom: 10px;\n}\nimg.tile-list-thumb {\nwidth: 50%;\nfloat: left;\n}\nli.tile-list-item ul {\nwidth: 50%;\nfloat: left;\nmargin: 0;\npadding-left: 15px;\n}\nli.tile-list-item li {\nfont-size: 14px;\nlist-style: disc;\nmargin-left: 15px;\n}\ntable.schedule_table {\nwidth: 100%;\n}\ntable.schedule_table th,\ntable.schedule_table td {\npadding: 4px;\n}\ntable.schedule_table th {\nfont-family: Metronic, sans-serif;\nfont-weight: normal;\ntext-align: left;\ncolor: #0099ff;\ntext-transform: uppercase;\n}\ntable.schedule_table td {\nfont-size: 14px;\nline-height: 18px;\nvertical-align: top;\n}\nul.schedule_list {\nmargin: 15px 0 30px 20px;\n}\nul.schedule_list li {\nfont-size: 14px;\n}\n@media (min-width: 564px) {\nli.tile-list-item {\nclear: none;\nmax-width: none;\nwidth: 31%;\nborder: none;\nmargin-bottom: 0;\n}\nli.tile-list-item:nth-child(2) {\nmargin: 0 3.5%;\n}\nimg.tile-list-thumb {\nwidth: 100%;\n}\nli.tile-list-item ul {\nclear: left;\nmargin-top: 15px;\nwidth: 100%;\n}\n}\n</style>\n<style class=\"blockquote-dev\" type=\"text/css\">blockquote {\nbackground: #140029;\nborder-left: 10px solid #320064;\nmargin: 1.5em 10px;\npadding: 0.5em 10px;;\nquotes: \"\\201C\"\"\\201D\"\"\\2018\"\"\\2019\";\n}\nblockquote p {\ndisplay: inline;\npadding: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n}\n</style>",
